function renderSavedAdventures(){const c=adventureCampaign();if(!c)return;const list=$("savedAdventureList"),items=(c.adventures||[]);$("adventureCount").textContent=`${items.length} adventure${items.length===1?"":"s"}`;list.innerHTML=items.length?items.map(a=>{const npcs=(a.npcIds||[]).map(id=>(c.npcs||[]).find(n=>n.id===id)?.name).filter(Boolean),creatures=(a.creatureIds||[]).map(id=>(c.customCreatures||[]).find(x=>x.id===id)?.name).filter(Boolean);return `<article class="saved-adventure-card"><div class="saved-adventure-top"><span class="tag">ADVENTURE FRAMEWORK</span><div><button class="secondary-btn" data-edit-adventure="${escapeHTML(a.id)}">Edit</button> <button class="text-btn" data-delete-adventure="${escapeHTML(a.id)}">Delete</button></div></div><h3>${escapeHTML(a.title)}</h3>${a.hook?`<p>${escapeHTML(a.hook)}</p>`:""}<div class="saved-adventure-facts">${a.objective?`<span><b>Objective</b>${escapeHTML(a.objective)}</span>`:""}${a.patron?`<span><b>Patron</b>${escapeHTML(a.patron)}</span>`:""}${a.antagonist?`<span><b>Opposition</b>${escapeHTML(a.antagonist)}</span>`:""}${npcs.length?`<span><b>NPCs</b>${escapeHTML(npcs.join(", "))}</span>`:""}${creatures.length?`<span><b>Creatures</b>${escapeHTML(creatures.join(", "))}</span>`:""}${a.locations?`<span><b>Locations</b>${escapeHTML(a.locations)}</span>`:""}${a.complications?`<span><b>Complications</b>${escapeHTML(a.complications)}</span>`:""}${a.rewards?`<span><b>Rewards</b>${escapeHTML(a.rewards)}</span>`:""}</div>${a.notes?`<details><summary>DM preparation notes</summary><p>${escapeHTML(a.notes)}</p></details>`:""}</article>`}).join(""):'<div class="placeholder-panel"><div class="placeholder-icon">✧</div><h3>No adventures saved yet</h3><p>Build your first adventure framework above, or generate an original story spark to get started.</p></div>'}
function saveAdventureRecord(e){e.preventDefault();const c=adventureCampaign();if(!c)return;const a={id:editingAdventureId||makeId(),title:$("adventureTitle").value.trim(),hook:$("adventureHook").value.trim(),patron:$("adventurePatron").value.trim(),objective:$("adventureObjective").value.trim(),npcIds:Array.from($("adventureNpcLinks").selectedOptions).map(o=>o.value),creatureIds:Array.from($("adventureCreatureLinks").selectedOptions).map(o=>o.value),antagonist:$("adventureAntagonist").value.trim(),locations:$("adventureLocations").value.trim(),complications:$("adventureComplications").value.trim(),rewards:$("adventureRewards").value.trim(),notes:$("adventureNotes").value.trim(),updated:new Date().toISOString()};if(!a.title){toast("Give this adventure a title first.");return}c.adventures=Array.isArray(c.adventures)?c.adventures:[];const i=c.adventures.findIndex(x=>x.id===editingAdventureId);if(i>=0)c.adventures[i]=a;else c.adventures.unshift(a);c.updated=new Date().toISOString();persistCampaigns();resetAdventureForm();renderSavedAdventures();renderSessionWorkspace();toast(i>=0?"Adventure updated.":"Adventure saved to campaign.")}
